+Get-Printer-Attributes Request, or the client <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> just name the &quot;job-template&quot;
+group in order to get the complete set of supported attributes (both
+supported and default attributes).</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2-5">The &quot;finishings&quot; attribute is an example of a Job Template attribute.
